(514, '67d2afec087b3', '2026-06-30 06:53:30', '2026-06-30 06:54:24', 0, '67d2afec087b3', 0, 'Cappuccino', 1, 0, NULL, '6285ddbfd9598', 0, '{\"arrayValue\":[]}', '0', NULL, '660bd3fea18f5', '{\"arrayValue\":[]}', 'https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/emart-8d99f.appspot.com/o/images%2FCappuccino_1742475593208.jpg?alt=media&token=2ce8d31c-b4ed-44ff-980b-16cffd76046a', -1, 0, NULL, '[\"https:\\/\\/firebasestorage.googleapis.com\\/v0\\/b\\/emart-8d99f.appspot.com\\/o\\/images%2FCappuccino_1742475593208.jpg?alt=media&token=2ce8d31c-b4ed-44ff-980b-16cffd76046a\"]', 'Indulge in the rich, velvety smoothness of our Cappuccino. Made with a perfect shot of bold espresso, steamed milk, and topped with a frothy layer of foam, this classic Italian coffee is the ultimate balance of creamy and bold. Served with a light dusting of cocoa powder, it’s the perfect companion for your morning routine or an afternoon pick-me-up. Enjoy the comforting warmth and richness in every sip.', NULL, 1, NULL, '10', '15', NULL, 'vv5LK0XCJTffI1tev2Eh', NULL, 0, '2025-03-13 10:14:33', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(515, '67d2b0e429491', '2026-06-30 06:53:30', '2026-06-30 06:54:24', 0, '67d2b0e429491', 0, 'Frittata', 1, 0, NULL, '6285ddbfd9598', 0, '{\"arrayValue\":[]}', '0', NULL, '660bd3fea18f5', '{\"arrayValue\":[]}', 'https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/emart-8d99f.appspot.com/o/images%2FFrittata_1742475710766.jpg?alt=media&token=a0528f15-0328-4f13-8a1b-adf34001e8cf', -1, 0, NULL, '[\"https:\\/\\/firebasestorage.googleapis.com\\/v0\\/b\\/emart-8d99f.appspot.com\\/o\\/images%2FFrittata_1742475710766.jpg?alt=media&token=a0528f15-0328-4f13-8a1b-adf34001e8cf\"]', 'Savor the wholesome goodness of our Frittata, an Italian-style omelet packed with fresh, flavorful ingredients. Made with a blend of farm-fresh eggs, sautéed vegetables, and your choice of cheese and meats, this versatile dish is perfectly cooked to a golden, melt-in-your-mouth finish. Whether enjoyed for breakfast, brunch, or as a light lunch, our Frittata is a satisfying, savory option that’s both hearty and flavorful.', NULL, 1, NULL, '20', '30', NULL, 'vv5LK0XCJTffI1tev2Eh', NULL, 0, '2025-03-13 10:18:43', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
