(520, '67d91c7476913', '2026-06-30 06:53:30', '2026-06-30 06:54:24', 0, '67d91c7476913', 0, 'Mexican Hot Chocolate', 1, 0, NULL, '6285ddbfd9598', 0, '[\"0\"]', '0', 0, '62ecef57887cb', '[\"cream\"]', 'https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/emart-8d99f.appspot.com/o/images%2FMexican%20Hot%20Chocolate%204_1742474696804.jpg?alt=media&token=7f4adecc-d396-4d11-b9b2-a2ddb1994f38', -1, 0, 0, '[\"https:\\/\\/firebasestorage.googleapis.com\\/v0\\/b\\/emart-8d99f.appspot.com\\/o\\/images%2FMexican%20Hot%20Chocolate%204_1742474696804.jpg?alt=media&token=7f4adecc-d396-4d11-b9b2-a2ddb1994f38\"]', 'Warm up with a rich and velvety cup of our Mexican Hot Chocolate! Crafted with a blend of dark chocolate, cinnamon, and a hint of vanilla, this indulgent drink offers a perfect balance of sweetness and spice. Traditionally made with frothy milk for that creamy, smooth texture, it\'s the ultimate comfort in a cup. Whisked to perfection with a traditional molinillo for an extra frothy finish, it\'s topped with a sprinkle of cinnamon and served with a smile. A cozy, flavorful treat to enjoy on its own or paired with one of our delicious pastries.', NULL, 1, NULL, '10', '14', NULL, 'vv5LK0XCJTffI1tev2Eh', '{\"mapValue\":[]}', 0, '2025-03-18 07:12:09', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
